{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/885575-kinship-outside-the-main-game-lines","id":885575,"title":"Kinship outside the main game lines","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-08T12:20:19-07:00","id":885575,"title":"Kinship outside the main game lines","content":"So outside of Vampires, Werewolves, Mages, Prometheans, Changelings, Geists and Mummies...<br /> <br /> What kind of creatures mentioned in other books could a Beast establish kinship with?<br /> <br /> Some of the most interesting to me are the 'unique' monsters out there (such as the ones describe in the CoD base book, or the Antagonists and Urban Legends books), and creatures like Skinchangers and Shapeshifters. What else have you guys thought of or considered?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T03:01:57-07:00","id":886063,"title":"","content":"The various main-line sub-splats are explicitly eligible (ghouls, etc).<br /> <br /> Possessed, or even Inferno Demons themselves, could be cool. Immortals from the book of the same name. Fractals could be valid (I could see an argument in either direction).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T03:03:44-07:00","id":886065,"title":"","content":"Where are Fractals from, Inodiv? Doesn't ring a bell...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T03:06:21-07:00","id":886066,"title":"","content":"They're a type of Offspring born to two demon parents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T18:32:29-07:00","id":891495,"title":"","content":"Considering some complained about beast being too crossover dependent, I think a game only using blue book stuff would be interesting, plenty of options- zombies, ghosts, revenants, imbued, psychics, thaumaturges, cultists, slashers, the possessed, spirits, horrors, immortals of various stripes, genius loci, etc.<br /> <br /> Beasts could make friends and enemies with all sorts without resorting to crossover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T22:12:19-07:00","id":891586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/885575-kinship-outside-the-main-game-lines?p=886063#post886063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The various main-line sub-splats are explicitly eligible (ghouls, etc).<br /> <br /> Possessed, or even Inferno Demons themselves, could be cool. Immortals from the book of the same name. Fractals could be valid (I could see an argument in either direction).</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say fractals wouldn't trigger kinship for the same reason demons don't - or at least kinship powers can't be built of their powers because of the source.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T07:10:40-07:00","id":891711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/885575-kinship-outside-the-main-game-lines?p=891586#post891586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd say fractals wouldn't trigger kinship for the same reason demons don't - or at least kinship powers can't be built of their powers because of the source.</div> </div> </div> </div>The same might also be said for Stigmatics, since the powers essentially derive from the same source.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T10:55:42-07:00","id":891863,"title":"","content":"Been reading through Changing Breeds a bit and I love the idea of kinship with one if only for bragging rights.<br /> <br /> &quot;You may be friends with a werewolf but my buddy is a wereTIGER!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T13:14:03-07:00","id":891957,"title":"","content":"What about kinship with horrors? I don't mean the beast ones but the blue book ones.<b